(6304923, 934115, 63244, '<td valign="top">Oh, antique books! One of my most favorite things in the world! Beautifully done with regards to color and lighting. I might have placed the paperback somewhat to one side or the other rather than dead center, but it''s a lovely photograph! Should you ever run across Dumas, The Count of Monti Christo and The Three Musketeers in burgundy cover with gilt pages, let me know. I am missing the three volumes to complete my collection! Love your book collection.</td>', 'Oh, antique books! One of my most favorite things in the world! Beautifully done with regards to color and lighting. I might have placed the paperback somewhat to one side or the other rather than dead center, but it''s a lovely photograph! Should you ever run across Dumas, The Count of Monti Christo and The Three Musketeers in burgundy cover with gilt pages, let me know. I am missing the three volumes to complete my collection! Love your book collection.', '2011-02-07 02:20:15.000000', NULL, 1),
