(6305214, 933712, 125410, '<td valign="top">Creative shot... I''m even giving you a bonus point to counter all the "wine glass whiners" think of it as a "Bravery Point" for making an entry with a wine glass ;)</td>', 'Creative shot... I''m even giving you a bonus point to counter all the "wine glass whiners" think of it as a "Bravery Point" for making an entry with a wine glass ;)', '2011-02-07 11:33:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6305216, 933975, 125410, '<td valign="top">Touching shot, did you know the birthday boy?<br/> <br/>Aesthetically, it''s a very well balanced shot, and my attention is drawn nicely to the subject. I''m guessing there was some dodge/burn PP done to bring that out, but it was done subtly enough that it doesn''t look unnatural.</td>', 'Touching shot, did you know the birthday boy? Aesthetically, it''s a very well balanced shot, and my attention is drawn nicely to the subject. I''m guessing there was some dodge/burn PP done to bring that out, but it was done subtly enough that it doesn''t look unnatural.', '2011-02-07 11:37:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6305219, 934167, 125410, '<td valign="top">Creative! I have never done a shot with active flame before, I imagine there is a narrow window of opportunity before you start risking your props. The lighting in this is quite nice, I imagine there is an off-camera light source amplifying the "torch" light, but it''s natural looking. Fill light works well on the gentleman in the front, but I wonder if it wouldn''t have been more effective to block a bit more fill light on the left side, to further separate the torch wielders, leaving them only in the orange-ish "fire" light.<br/> <br/>All and all, excellent shot.</td>', 'Creative! I have never done a shot with active flame before, I imagine there is a narrow window of opportunity before you start risking your props. The lighting in this is quite nice, I imagine there is an off-camera light source amplifying the "torch" light, but it''s natural looking. Fill light works well on the gentleman in the front, but I wonder if it wouldn''t have been more effective to block a bit more fill light on the left side, to further separate the torch wielders, leaving them only in the orange-ish "fire" light. All and all, excellent shot.', '2011-02-07 11:43:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6305220, 934154, 125410, '<td valign="top">Depending on where this shot was taken, and knowing the current weather patterns, it''s quite possible that the snow is the item that doesn''t belong! Colorful shot :)</td>', 'Depending on where this shot was taken, and knowing the current weather patterns, it''s quite possible that the snow is the item that doesn''t belong! Colorful shot :)', '2011-02-07 11:44:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6305222, 934109, 125410, '<td valign="top">Artistic shot. I''m not factoring it into my score (and I know there are all sorts of issues that come with it) but I wonder if a small border wouldn''t have helped this shot, since I feel like there is "more" to it on the edges that I''m not quite seeing.</td>', 'Artistic shot. I''m not factoring it into my score (and I know there are all sorts of issues that come with it) but I wonder if a small border wouldn''t have helped this shot, since I feel like there is "more" to it on the edges that I''m not quite seeing.', '2011-02-07 11:46:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6305224, 934125, 125410, '<td valign="top">It removes snow... just, in a much smaller area...<br/> <br/>Nice use of diagonal lines in this shot.</td>', 'It removes snow... just, in a much smaller area... Nice use of diagonal lines in this shot.', '2011-02-07 11:48:15.000000', NULL, 1),
