(6309046, 934151, 118154, '<td valign="top">"Your entry should have a small collection of items with one of those items being something that clearly doesn''t belong with rest"<br/> <br/>DNMC in my eyes ?</td>', '"Your entry should have a small collection of items with one of those items being something that clearly doesn''t belong with rest" DNMC in my eyes ?', '2011-02-10 11:43:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6309050, 933697, 118154, '<td valign="top">Great idea lol.</td>', 'Great idea lol.', '2011-02-10 11:46:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6309145, 933859, 116649, '<td valign="top">Is it the mushroom because it is a fungus?  The Strawberry because it is a fruit?  Wait, bell peppers and tomatos contain seeds, thus are fruits also...   And when mushrooms turn from fungus to their familiar form, the transformation is call "fruiting"....   Confused now....   Must be the Onion!  It is the only true vegetable among the fruits?  Did I get it right?  Do I win the prize?</td>', 'Is it the mushroom because it is a fungus?  The Strawberry because it is a fruit?  Wait, bell peppers and tomatos contain seeds, thus are fruits also...   And when mushrooms turn from fungus to their familiar form, the transformation is call "fruiting"....   Confused now....   Must be the Onion!  It is the only true vegetable among the fruits?  Did I get it right?  Do I win the prize?', '2011-02-10 13:20:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6309148, 934120, 116649, '<td valign="top">I love the detail you brought ut of the farm eggs...</td>', 'I love the detail you brought ut of the farm eggs...', '2011-02-10 13:23:13.000000', NULL, 1),
