(6309943, 934151, 96751, '<td valign="top">Awesome eye!  Very epic and well done interpretation of the challenge.  I''m looking forward to see how voters respond to this.  If anything like me, should be on the front page.</td>', 'Awesome eye!  Very epic and well done interpretation of the challenge.  I''m looking forward to see how voters respond to this.  If anything like me, should be on the front page.', '2011-02-11 13:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
