(6313796, 933884, 66384, '<td valign="top">Well done!!! Pearl looks just like the two ornamental cats. Perfect pose. The color of the three cats is an excellent match, and I like the pavers. Glad you got a decent score and placement on this one.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-02-14 19:25:16.</i></td>', 'Well done!!! Pearl looks just like the two ornamental cats. Perfect pose. The color of the three cats is an excellent match, and I like the pavers. Glad you got a decent score and placement on this one.', '2011-02-14 19:24:33.000000', '2011-02-14 19:25:16.000000', 0),
(6313824, 933138, 100831, '<td valign="top">cute.</td>', 'cute.', '2011-02-14 19:55:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(6313913, 932903, 50864, '<td valign="top">Oh no.  You''ve done it again.  I better get something entered.  I''d hate to slip behind on the race for the brown.<br/> <br/>Another really great image. Beautiful light. And, by the way, it is clear what doesn''t belong.   It''s just hard to tell if that is a bottle of sunflower kernels or a bottle of mixed nuts. That''s probably what threw everyone off.</td>', 'Oh no.  You''ve done it again.  I better get something entered.  I''d hate to slip behind on the race for the brown. Another really great image. Beautiful light. And, by the way, it is clear what doesn''t belong.   It''s just hard to tell if that is a bottle of sunflower kernels or a bottle of mixed nuts. That''s probably what threw everyone off.', '2011-02-14 20:44:46.000000', NULL, 0),
