(6315512, 933138, 96901, '<td valign="top">Creative idea, but some technical things are distracting me: there are a bunch of specular highlights in the glass and you can see a lot of stuff from the studio reflecting in the spoons and the forks, as well as a highlight on your plate.  Maybe try to use softer lighting and a reflector (like white foam core or something) to fill in where there are reflections.</td>', 'Creative idea, but some technical things are distracting me: there are a bunch of specular highlights in the glass and you can see a lot of stuff from the studio reflecting in the spoons and the forks, as well as a highlight on your plate.  Maybe try to use softer lighting and a reflector (like white foam core or something) to fill in where there are reflections.', '2011-02-15 18:19:33.000000', NULL, 0),
