(6320567, 934121, 101117, '<td valign="top">I was just looking at the front page and was wondering why I didn''t see any of your pictures here, this explains it!<br/> <br/>Shame about the DQ, it''s always great to see your images, and even though this one was DQ''d, it''s still stunning and very well done.<br/> <br/>Looking forward to seeing you back in the challenges after your suspension, you set a high benchmark for the rest of us to chase!</td>', 'I was just looking at the front page and was wondering why I didn''t see any of your pictures here, this explains it! Shame about the DQ, it''s always great to see your images, and even though this one was DQ''d, it''s still stunning and very well done. Looking forward to seeing you back in the challenges after your suspension, you set a high benchmark for the rest of us to chase!', '2011-02-19 08:12:34.000000', NULL, 0),
