(6326805, 934121, 68546, '<td valign="top">I''m quite surprised that a reflector right over to one side would be considered a major element. Shame as it''s great work as always Christoph. Don''t let a small suspension get you down, I look forward to seeing more of your creative flare soon!!</td>', 'I''m quite surprised that a reflector right over to one side would be considered a major element. Shame as it''s great work as always Christoph. Don''t let a small suspension get you down, I look forward to seeing more of your creative flare soon!!', '2011-02-22 15:56:43.000000', NULL, 0),
